config SOC_RRAM_TELINK_TLX
	bool "Telink TLx RRAM (NVM) driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TELINK_TLX_RRAM_ENABLED
	select FLASH_HAS_PAGE_LAYOUT
	select FLASH_HAS_DRIVER_ENABLED
	help
	  Enables Telink TLx on-chip RRAM (Resistive RAM / NVM) driver.

	  RRAM is the on-chip non-volatile memory on TLx series MCUs.
	  Key differences from external SPI Flash:
	    - No physical erasure needed (direct overwrite)
	    - Minimum write granularity: 16 bytes
	    - Empty state: all zeros (0x00)
	    - Zero wear-leveling (byte-addressable overwrite)